**Per file**
- Graham Campbell owns 8 of the 10 files. Those are `EntryParser`, `Lexer`, `Lines`, `Parser`, `ParserInterface`, `Regex`, `Value` and `Entry`. In most of them he wrote essentially all surviving lines.
- Dmitri Volkov wrote `CommentStripper.php`. Only the StyleCI Bot lines differ.
- Fatima Zahra wrote `EscapeDecoder.php`. Only the StyleCI Bot lines differ.

**Who should review**
- **Default reviewer: Graham Campbell.** They last committed on 2026-02-27, so they are still active. They are the only person who knows most of this code.
- **Changes to comment handling:** add Dmitri Volkov.
- **Changes to escape handling:** add Fatima Zahra.
